			"environment": {
				"GRATE_DUMP_RAW": "1"
			},
			"expected_note": "size 4, one packet per batch, batch 3 slot 0 writes 0.375 (0x60) and batch 0 slot 0 reads alu0: 0x60 if the M=4 wrap works when each batch holds one packet, which separates M=4 from the two-packets-per-batch shape",
